{
 "chart_notes": [
  "non-life insurer (J-GAAP 損害保険業 format).",
  "premiums is net premiums WRITTEN (正味収入保険料) plus life premiums of life subsidiaries (生命保険料), not premiums earned: J-GAAP has no earned-premium element. Label it 'premiums written'.",
  "claims is net claims PAID (正味支払保険金 + 損害調査費 + 生命保険金等), not incurred; the outstanding-claims provision (支払備金繰入額) is inside reserve_provision.",
  "reserve_change = reserve_provision (支払備金繰入額 + 責任準備金等繰入額, in 経常費用) - reserve_reversal (支払備金戻入額 + 責任準備金等戻入額, in 経常収益). Because a reversal sits inside total_revenue, use reserve_provision, not reserve_change, when building up total_expenses.",
  "investment_income is 資産運用収益, gross and incl. realised gains; investment_expenses (資産運用費用) is the matching expense line.",
  "opex is derived: 経常費用 - claims - reserve_provision - investment_expenses. It holds 諸手数料及び集金費 (acquisition_costs), 営業費及び一般管理費 (admin_expenses), 満期返戻金 and other underwriting and ordinary expenses.",
  "pretax_income = 経常利益 + extraordinary items.",
  "policy_reserves is the filed total 保険契約準備金 (支払備金 + 責任準備金等); 責任準備金等 holds unearned premiums and catastrophe reserves and is not split in J-GAAP, so unearned_premiums stays empty.",
  "cash is 現金及び預貯金; the cash flow statement ends on 現金及び現金同等物. The tie-out uses the filing's own reconciliation note only if it foots, else flags.",
  "equity_parent is derived (株主資本 + その他の包括利益累計額)."
 ],
